<item><title>Sambi rejects UAE evacuation terms as Comoros talks continue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/km/sambi-rejects-uae-evacuation-terms-as-comoros-talks-continue-756aa9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/km/sambi-rejects-uae-evacuation-terms-as-comoros-talks-continue-756aa9/</guid><category>Comoros</category><description>The jailed former president seeks guarantees on treatment and his return, while officials left Moroni without an agreement after a November visit.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:15:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/km/sambi-rejects-uae-evacuation-terms-as-comoros-talks-continue-756aa9/share.jpg" length="41183" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/km/sambi-rejects-uae-evacuation-terms-as-comoros-talks-continue-756aa9/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
